{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision platformer where you maneuver your unicycle though dozens of levels and side modes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become one with the Unicycleverse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features very simple controls that are hard to master: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean left, lean right and jump, very simple. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these controls allow you to do many things in different contexts. On the ground; alternate leaning left and right to peddle; allowing to move. In the air; lean left or right to flip left or right, paired with a jump; this effectively doubles your jump height! You can also wall jump!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3155170?t=1771826594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155170/58260e2e057e6d84f4442802fb100ec28b86a32c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771826594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155170/e5f312d84d0d767c3989365ff26bcc593bc53243/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771826594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155170/e5f312d84d0d767c3989365ff26bcc593bc53243/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771826594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision platformer where you maneuver your unicycle though dozens of levels and side modes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become one with the Unicycleverse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features very simple controls that are hard to master: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean left, lean right and jump, very simple. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these controls allow you to do many things in different contexts. On the ground; alternate leaning left and right to peddle; allowing to move. In the air; lean left or right to flip left or right, paired with a jump; this effectively doubles your jump height! You can also wall jump!</p>","developers":["mesklar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155170/7d3fd442c5772898fffd1a5ba5196519963d4d63/header.jpg?t=1771826594","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155170/1936900096/0a3fefd309d92f2c8a37fd13793bbf4fc29493a1/1750875808/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750129808","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155170/1936900096/0a3fefd309d92f2c8a37fd13793bbf4fc29493a1/1750875808/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750129808","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3155170/1936900096/0a3fefd309d92f2c8a37fd13793bbf4fc29493a1/1750875808/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750129808","id":257156185,"name":"Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156185/77720b0e9784dcbf190bc3f8267f122dac7d526d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750129808"}],"name":"One with the Unicycleverse","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3+ compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false